00:42:36,869 --> 00:42:59,655
Back in the 1930s, a South African geologist named Alexander Detois published research comparing glacial deposits from the Karu with other similar deposits in India and Brazil and Australia, noting the suspicious similarities between these rock formations, despite being currently separated by oceans.

