00:46:14,628 --> 00:46:35,812
Yeah, mountains are heavy and that matters. Yes. This basin was way back initially, filled by the Karu Sea, which was a seaway that was home. We get marine fossils, there's a shark like fish in there that's called Duica Solacus, named the same way as the Duica group.

