That was just everywhere. That was just everywhere. Moscops, which is the ones with the little head and the big body that make me and only me think of the Goombas from the 1993 Super Mario Brothers movie. Only me. And Gorgonopsids, along with many other Gorgonopsids were the large saber-toothed predators among the early Synapsids.

